      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "TIT",
          "chapter": 3,
          "verse": 7
        }
      ],
      "en": "that being justified by his grace, we might be made heirs according to the hope of eternal life.",
      "ko": "우리로 저의 은혜를 힘입어 의롭다 하심을 얻어 영생의 소망을 따라 후사가 되게 하려 하심이라",
      "source_text_hash": "550f1a58be82c3d23411bb70c4e545a96f3be6821f3baa6296ffee4d20e644cf",
      "translation_text_hash": "56e8b9962c8cb7d24ea52d1def630679db75073554bef44c173f9591e9403c75",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
